      "tab_support": "Support",
      "summary_default": "Pick a position",
      "summary_fmt": "{pos}",
      "summary_cnt": "{pos} · {n} added",
      "hint": "Pick a position from the tabs, then click champions to allow or disallow them there. A listed champion can play the positions it is listed in and any position whose list is empty; an unlisted champion can only play empty positions. Rules and formulas: see the middle column.",
      "rules_title": "Position Lock rules",
      "rules_close": "Close",
      "rules_switch": "Rules on/off",
      "rules_open": "Rules",
      "rules_short": "■ Where a champion can play\n· Added to a list → those positions + empty positions (nobody added)\n· Not added anywhere → empty positions only\n\n■ When a limit turns on\nIt turns on when 'champions that can play it' ≥ 'needed'. If short, anyone can play that position (so the draft never gets stuck).\n\n■ Needed = base + extra\n· Base = my pick 1 + both teams' bans (ban cards×2) + champions used up in one position\n· Used up = opponent's pick this set 1 + ones used in earlier sets → normal 1 · fearless 5 · hard 9 (for 5 sets)\n· So base = normal 2+bans×2 · fearless 6+bans×2 · hard 10+bans×2 (e.g. hard + 5 bans = 20)\n· Extra = if this position's champions can also play other positions, as many as can be taken there (up to 9 per other position, hard)\n  - anyone can play an empty position, so usually the full 9 (e.g. only top filled: 20 + 9×4 = 56)\n  - filling other positions lowers it toward the base (20)\n· Champions in several lists are checked again as a group\n· 'N more needed' is counted by adding them one by one\n\n■ Ban cards\nYour setting, lowered like the game when champions are too few (3 with 40+ released, else 2)\n\n■ Draft · swap\n· Champions that would make positions impossible are grey (hover for the reason)\n· A position that can't be filled lets you pick anyone for it\n· A wrong swap is fixed once automatically; you can't confirm while it's wrong\n· AI teams follow the same rules\n\n■ Saving: changes apply at once; press 'OK' to save",
      "clear_pos": "Clear this position (allow all)",
      "select_all_pos": "Select all for this position",
      "class_all_title": "Select all by class (click again to clear)",
      "cancel": "Cancel",
      "ok": "Confirm",
      "swaptip": "This swap is not valid.",
      "search_placeholder": "Search champion name...",
      "class_all": "All",
      "class_melee": "Fighter",
